:: R4_DriveHome [r4 story]
<<scene "In Transit, Night" "files/images/mood/r4-drivehome-car-night.png">>
<<objective "Drive home.">>

The drive home takes thirty-one minutes. Traffic on the bridge. I sit in the left lane behind a pickup truck and feel the panties cooling against my skin. The silk is stiff where it dried. Victoria's instruction was clear. Don't wash them. Tomorrow I put these back on, crusted and fragrant, and wear the evidence of today's surrender against my cock for another eight hours.

I pull into the parking garage of our building at 7:14 PM. Kill the engine. Sit in the dark for a moment. The leather seat is cool. The panties are warm. My cock is soft now but the memory of hardness is everywhere, in the dampness, in the slight chafe of lace against skin that's been stimulated all day.

Lena's car is in her spot. She's home from yoga. Or from wherever she actually goes in her yoga pants with her mat rolled under her arm and that look on her face like she's been somewhere good.

I get out. Walk to the elevator. Each step is a whisper of silk. By tomorrow morning, the whisper will smell like me.

